### StudyPlan API — manual tests (VS Code REST Client or similar)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Courses (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses

### Login — sets session cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "password"
}

### Current student (requires login cookie from above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/current

### Study plan (requires login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan

### Create empty plan (user with no plan yet)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "part"
}

### Add course to plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "03UEWOV"
}

### Remove course from plan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan/courses/03UEWOV

### Save plan (validate credits; optional full list for cancel)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courses": ["01OTWOV", "01SQLOV", "01UDFOV", "01OUZPD"]
}

### Delete entire plan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/study-plan

### Logout
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/current
